  "body": "### Description\n\nNobody except admins are able to redact their own messages. Deleting message shows that it failed to send and gives retry button for the redaction in element.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create room on version 9\r\n- Wait for a long time\r\n- Notice that it started happening, maybe. Could've not happened, no idea what triggers it.\n\n### Homeserver\n\nHappened on several servers, my own included.\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.79.0\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\n\n### Database\n\nPostgreSQL\n\n### Workers\n\nSingle process\n\n### Platform\n\nHas happened on various synapse servers\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nThere's no log for it\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
